{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23403","headline":"引泉 · 白居易","name":"引泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一爲止足限，二爲衰疾牵。\n邴罢不因事，陶归非待年。\n归来嵩洛下，闭户何翛然。\n静扫林下地，闲疏池畔泉。\n伊流狭似带，洛石大如拳。\n谁教明月下，爲我声溅溅。\n竟夕舟中坐，有时桥上眠。\n何用施屏障，水竹绕牀前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23403.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23403","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}